<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#S2.SS2.p1.1" title="2.2 Diffusion-based Posterior Sampling Methods ‣ 2 Background ‣ Sample-efficient evidence estimation of score based priors for model selection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§2.2</span></a>,
<a href="#S4.SS3.p2.1" title="4.3 Evaluating Prior Model Evidence for Real M87* Black Hole Data ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Sample-efficient evidence estimation of score based priors for model selection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§4.3</span></a>.
</span></li>
