<a href="#S2.SS2.p1.1" title="2.2 Diffusion-based Posterior Sampling Methods ‣ 2 Background ‣ Sample-efficient evidence estimation of score based priors for model selection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§2.2</span></a>.
</span></li>
