<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Synthetic Model Selection</h2>

<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we perform model selection on the same set of five priors as in Section <a href="#S4.SS3.SSS1" title="4.3.1 Model selection ‣ 4.3 Evaluating Prior Model Evidence for Real M87* Black Hole Data ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Sample-efficient evidence estimation of score based priors for model selection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3.1</span></a>, but on simulated closure quantities measurements of test images from each prior as verification. The correct model is chosen for all measurements. The posterior samples with the lowest, mean, and highest path evidences are also shown in each case.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A6.F7" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.20549v1/gaussian_grmhd_cropped.png" id="A6.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:466/240;" width="466" height="240" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Ground truth: GRMHD.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A6.F8" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.20549v1/gaussian_space_cropped.png" id="A6.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:466/241;" width="466" height="241" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Ground truth: SpaceNet.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A6.F9" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.20549v1/gaussian_celeba_cropped.png" id="A6.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:466/237;" width="466" height="237" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9: </span>Ground truth: CelebA.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A6.F10" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.20549v1/gaussian_mnist_cropped.png" id="A6.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:466/246;" width="466" height="246" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>Ground truth: MNIST.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A6.F11" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.20549v1/gaussian_riaf_cropped.png" id="A6.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:466/239;" width="466" height="239" alt="Refer to caption">
